Hi Håvard,

Thanks very much for your prompt response. I totally appreciate that these unintended changes can creep in through time. And thanks for considering bringing the older relaxed permissions back. I was mostly curious for my own coding routine, though hopefully this post helps others who might encounter similar issues. Like I mentioned, brute forcing relaxed permissions via the Dockerfile (not a big deal) fixed the issue for me.

All the best,
Diego

